WEBVTT

00:04:29.438 --> 00:04:30.597
"This is my life."

00:04:30.597 --> 00:04:31.527
One guy wrote,

00:04:31.527 --> 00:04:33.066
"It's funny because it's true.

00:04:33.066 --> 00:04:34.973
Eerily, sadly, depressingly true.

00:04:34.973 --> 00:04:36.691
It made me laugh until I cried.

00:04:36.691 --> 00:04:39.441
And cried. And I cried some more."

00:04:39.441 --> 00:04:41.073
(Laughter)

00:04:41.073 --> 00:04:42.534
This poor guy said,

00:04:42.534 --> 00:04:47.611
"My daily life until 
retirement or death, sigh."

00:04:47.611 --> 00:04:49.011
These are real quotes

00:04:49.011 --> 00:04:50.810
and it's real sad.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.633
A common theme running through
all of these comments online

00:04:53.633 --> 00:04:56.174
is this fundamental belief 
that we are powerless

00:04:56.174 --> 00:04:58.075
to do anything other 
than go to meetings

00:04:58.075 --> 00:05:00.453
and suffer through these 
poorly run meetings